      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32505279779434204
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 45,
      "text": "She has also disclosed about her five months pregnency in her statement.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2317,
      "end": 2389,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22101905941963196
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 46,
      "text": "Having heard learned counsel for the parties and taking into consideration that petitioner has committed heinous crime and there is direct allegation of committing rape against the petitioner, I am not inclined to grant bail to the petitioner and, as such, his application for bail is rejected.",
